### Update Patient - Full Update
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/patients/{{patientId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ahmed Mohamed Updated",
  "email": "ahmed.updated@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+201234567899",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-15",
  "address": "456 New Street, Cairo, Egypt"
}

###

### Update Patient - Partial Update (Email only)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/patients/{{patientId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ahmed.newemail@example.com"
}

###

### Update Patient - Partial Update (Name and Phone)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/patients/{{patientId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Name",
  "phoneNumber": "+201999999999"
}

###
